# Rockafellar, Part VIII: Convex Algebra

This module collects §§38–39 of [rockafellar1970convex], which the book prints as Part VIII: the
algebra of convex bifunctions (addition, scalar multiplication, application and composition, and how
each behaves under taking adjoints), and convex processes, the multivalued maps whose graphs are
convex cones that contain the origin. All 21 numbered results of Part VIII are formalized. The
backbone proves each of them over a general real vector space, and the two section modules
specialize these results to $\mathbb{R}^n$.

## Contents

| Source | Module | Subject |
|---|---|---|
| §38 The algebra of bifunctions | `Chapter08.Section38` | 12 results |
| §39 Convex processes | `Chapter08.Section39` | 9 results |
